class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15.10.46b862<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 21, 2025<br/>Summer Update 2025</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250628082925&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Norcferatu_Nightweaver_87e80e.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a norcferatu nightweaver.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Darkness shall engulf you!</li><li>See the shadows lurking!</li><li>Fear the night!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>A perversion of orcish shamanistic tradition, the Norcferatu Nightweaver is a vile caster who fuses blood magic with forgotten rites of shadow worship. While their ancestors once were seers and spiritual leaders of their clans, this new generation has embraced the darkness so deeply they no longer distinguish between vision and nightmare. The Nightweavers call upon the shadows not as allies, but as limbs, tendrils, and mouths, extensions of their own warped minds.\n</p><p>Where light ends, their power begins. They weave illusions of safety, then stab through them with blades made of dark. They blind their enemies with sudden bursts of pitch-black fog, only to appear behind them with a whisper and a dagger dipped in cursed vitae. To them, darkness is not the absence of light - it is a living force, eager to consume.\nTheir robes reek of ancient blood. Their eyes glow faintly with the crimson of their many sacrifices. The rituals they perform are often seen as madness by outsiders, but to the Nightweavers, every scar is a syllable in an eternal chant. In battle, they are not only dangerous, they are utterly unpredictable. They will warp the battlefield itself into a reflection of their lunacy.\nOne of their most twisted creations are the Abominable Blood Vortexes - whirling manifestations of darkness, blood, and madness. These eerie entities often accompany their creators as minions, familiars, or serve as messengers and watchful eyes.\n</p><p>\nWorse still, they are the evangelists of the Norcferatu's twisted gospel, spreading the cult of the blood god through whispered promises and arcane corruption.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"4312576280fe2ac417ea99da9a9e785b\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=